Description: Trindle Toolkit - Rust source code
 Windows on Wayland, drawing, text, icons, a style sheet, the screen reader
 link and the input method, in plain Rust. Trindle and its programs
 build-depend on this package.
 .
 This package contains the source for the Rust crate trindle-toolkit,
 packaged for use by cargo and the Debian Rust build tools.
